is on which side, and chooses the exit

104
00:07:21,382 --> 00:07:26,336
that keeps the most options open. The engineer
who does badly types the command that

105
00:07:26,376 --> 00:07:27,347
worked last time.

106
00:07:27,687 --> 00:07:32,890
The undo decision tree of section 11.12 is
the same discipline for the other half of

107
00:07:32,930 --> 00:07:38,009
